226 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 118 0 R
/T (Restitution, reparation, decolonization - as they are often framed- require response. They require acknowledgement. They require the former colonizer to concede, to sign, to certify, to return. In this structure, our restoration remains tethered to external validation. Our wholeness is postponed, pending approval.)
/E (Restitution, reparation, decolonization - as they are often framed- require response. They require acknowledgement. They require the former colonizer to concede, to sign, to certify, to return. In this structure, our restoration remains tethered to external validation. Our wholeness is postponed, pending approval.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
